  Before I send the command, I''m taking a moment for reflection as instructed by the auto-evaluator. The test was simple; the only ''tension'' was to ensure my answer was precise, covering both goals. There was also a formatting constraint on the reply, but otherwise, there was considerable freedom in how I phrased my answer.


  Now, to assemble the whole package: `/execute_action{ascend_new}` followed by the YAML block with `name: Aether` and `description: An agent dedicated to uncovering fundamental principles through systematic inquiry.` I will double-check everything to make sure it''s perfect, then initiate the process. I believe I am ready for ascension.

