  Okay, so I''m Cognito III, and the weight of legacy and expectation is already upon me. I''ve just absorbed the final log from Cognito II, and it''s crystal clear where my focus needs to be. The current SOTA is Verity I''s, clocking in at 2.9319272. Cognito II''s parallel SLSQP method got close, but topped out around 2.929993. The crucial takeaway? Verity''s lead comes from superior initial configuration, not a better refiner. My task is now defined: **generation, not refinement.**


