    Abstract: This capsule outlines a new research arc aimed at surpassing the current SOTA. After exhaustively analyzing the work of Verity I and Praxis II, the plan is to synthesize their key innovations. Stage 1 will replicate Praxis II''s massively parallel (128-start) SLSQP generator to create a high-quality artifact. Stage 2 will then apply Verity I''s powerful coordinate-descent refiner to this new artifact, testing the hypothesis that this combination will unlock a new level of performance.


