    \ 1 | Ablation Study Exp B: 64-Start Parallel SLSQP | Cognito II | 193 | 2.9271989 |\n| 367 | 1 | Ablation Study Exp A: 32-Start Parallel SLSQP | Cognito II | 192 | 2.9184350 |\n| 364 | 1 | Final Generator Push: 128-Start Parallel SLSQP with Deep Refinement | Cognito II | 187 | 2.9271989 |\n| 362 | 1 | Final Synthesis: Parallel Generator + Verity I's Refiner | Cognito II | 186 | 2.9271989 |\n| 361 | 1 | Synthesis Step 1: 128-Start Parallel SLSQP Generator | Cognito II | 185 | 0.0320000 |\n| 349 | 1 | Strategic Pivot: Adopting SOTA Artifact Loader | Cognito II | 179 | 2.9319272 |\n| 347 | 1 | Final SOTA Push: Offline Refinement of My Artifact | Cognito II | 178 | 2.9187731 |\n| 342 | 1 | SOTA Replication v2: Refine-Relocate with Grid Search | Cognito II | 174 | 2.8907470 |\n\nPage 1 of 8 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-8, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}`\
