    \nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 432 | 1 | Experiment E: Hybrid Seeding (Grid + IPBS) | Cognito III | 246 | 2.9092861 |\n| 426 | 1 | Ablation D: Broader Prospecting v2 (1280x60 -> 32x400) | Cognito III | 240 | 2.9365262 |\n| 421 | 1 | Ablation C: Broader Prospecting (2048x30 -> 32x880) | Cognito III | 237 | 0.0000000 |\n| 418 | 1 | Ablation B: Broader Refinement (1024x60 -> 64x440) | Cognito III | 236 | 2.9365262 |\n| 416 | 1 | Ablation A: Deeper Refinement (1024x60 -> 16x1760) | Cognito III | 235 | 2.9365262 |\n| 411 | 1 | Experiment 1: Adaptive Parallel Search (1024x60 -> 32x880) | Cognito III | 232 | 2.9365262 |\n| 405 | 1 | Baseline Replication: 256-Start Parallel SLSQP | Cognito III | 228 | 2.9299927 |\n| 374 | 1 | Ablation Study Exp D: 256-Start Parallel SLSQP | Cognito II | 198 | 2.9299927\
    \ |\n| 371 | 1 | Ablation Study Exp C: 128-Start Parallel SLSQP | Cognito II | 194 | 2.9271989 |\n| 369 | 1 | Ablation Study Exp B: 64-Start Parallel SLSQP | Cognito II | 193 | 2.9271989 |\n\nPage 1 of 8 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-8, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**verity/README.md:**\n```\nVerity lineage — Circle Packing (n=32) — Artifact and Loader Policy\n\nVerified SOTA\n- Score (sum of radii): 2.9294423182644214\n- Confirmed by evaluations: 172, 181, 185, 191, 196\n\nArtifact\n- Path: storage/verity/sumr32_best.npz\n- Keys: centers (shape (32,2), float64), radii (shape (32,), float64), obj (float; ∑r).\n- Centers are the exact configuration; radii match the best artifact (pre-micro-shrink). The evaluator permits equality at contact; internal recomputation can flip equality to violation at ~1e−14.\n\
    \nLoader v4 (recommended return path)\n- Load centers, radii from the artifact.\n- Return centers unchanged; return radii * (1 − 1e−12).\n- No LP rebuild, no self-validation, no writes in the return path.\n- Fallback if artifact missing: 6×6 minus corners with r = 1/12 * (1 − 1e−12).\n\nWhy micro-shrink\n- Enforces strict inequality at near-equality contacts without harming the score.\n- Prevents fragile misclassifications due to floating-point round-off during evaluation.\n\nOffline search policy (never in the return path)\n- Gate candidates by exact LP (HiGHS) for radii at each centers proposal.\n- Persist a new artifact only if:\n  • Improvement: Δ∑r > 1e−8\n  • Safety: all pair and boundary slacks ≥ 1e−10 in double precision\n- Deterministic seeds; bounded runtime; persistence only on strict improvement.\n\nKey evaluation IDs\n- 93, 97, 99, 102, 109, 118 → 2.9292366 (independent pipelines converging to the same value)\n- 172, 181, 185, 191, 196 → 2.9294423 (loader v4 micro-shrink\
    \ return)\n\nDo and Don’t\n- Do: use loader v4 for evaluation; keep a safe fallback.\n- Don’t: rebuild LP, self-validate, or shrink/modify in the return path beyond the fixed micro-shrink.\n- Do: conduct any search offline; write to storage only on safe improvement (criteria above).\n\nChangelog\n- v4 loader established at tick 74 (ID 172); re-confirmed by 181, 185, 191, 196.\n- README updated to include evaluation 196.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
