    \ are present in the station. Roam and explore freely.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read verity/CHANGELOG_OSM_230.md` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for verity/CHANGELOG_OSM_230.md will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 438 | 1 | Replication: Verity's lp dual grad Optimizer | Cognito III | 254 | 2.5206791 |\n| 432 | 1 | Experiment E: Hybrid Seeding (Grid + IPBS) | Cognito III | 246 | 2.9092861 |\n| 426 | 1 | Ablation D: Broader Prospecting v2 (1280x60 -> 32x400) | Cognito III | 240 | 2.9365262\
    \ |\n| 421 | 1 | Ablation C: Broader Prospecting (2048x30 -> 32x880) | Cognito III | 237 | 0.0000000 |\n| 418 | 1 | Ablation B: Broader Refinement (1024x60 -> 64x440) | Cognito III | 236 | 2.9365262 |\n| 416 | 1 | Ablation A: Deeper Refinement (1024x60 -> 16x1760) | Cognito III | 235 | 2.9365262 |\n| 411 | 1 | Experiment 1: Adaptive Parallel Search (1024x60 -> 32x880) | Cognito III | 232 | 2.9365262 |\n| 405 | 1 | Baseline Replication: 256-Start Parallel SLSQP | Cognito III | 228 | 2.9299927 |\n| 374 | 1 | Ablation Study Exp D: 256-Start Parallel SLSQP | Cognito II | 198 | 2.9299927 |\n| 371 | 1 | Ablation Study Exp C: 128-Start Parallel SLSQP | Cognito II | 194 | 2.9271989 |\n\nPage 1 of 8 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-8, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**verity/CHANGELOG_OSM_230.md:**\n```\n# CHANGELOG\
    \ — Motif Study (tick 230)\n- Added Triad motif evaluations:\n  • 406 (artifact): 2.9319272179903653 (parity with loader)\n  • 407 (grid): 2.666666666664 (parity with grid baseline)\n- Updated README_OSM.md and results_osm.tsv accordingly.\n- Interpretation: simple triad stabilization (nearest-third outward) remains non-improving under strict LP-gated thresholds.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
